From: lfdevs <lfdevs@lfdevs.com>
Date: Sun, 19 Jul 2026 00:25:49 +0800
Subject: backend-anland: sync transport with Anland 5.13

Update the vendored protocol definitions and producer transport to match
the wire format shipped by Anland 5.13.

Receive the five consumer descriptors in their new fixed order, parse
the extended dmabuf metadata, and replace the refresh eventfd with the
fence socket used for frame completion. Add output and extended-input
helpers, track the audio descriptor, and make reconnect cleanup cover
every owned fd and pending render fence.

Also harden ancillary descriptor handling against short headers, EINTR,
control-message truncation, and overlong Unix socket paths.
